{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the adjoining figure triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79acca1cedca0d43e9d183383ef794ad7932baa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/b/12bbdd583204bb805c2582d9715858631441d410.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = 8$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />. IF <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5ff974f1fc83a4612a432a53cfcdd5d56b9797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM = 3$\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />, what is the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/2/f42fe5450102486dda1fdec4c1520e55ac6dee3e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-4,0)--(4,0)--(-1,4)--cycle); draw((-1, 4)--(0, 0.00001)); label(&quot;B&quot;, (-4,0), S); label(&quot;C&quot;, (4,0), S); label(&quot;A&quot;, (-1, 4), N); label(&quot;M&quot;, (0, 0.0001), S); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"162\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/9/0897ab821217017a2ecf141cec995c435f0e8ea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\sqrt{26} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\sqrt{31} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 + 2\\sqrt{13}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{not enough information given to solve the problem}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"405\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccfe8a4216f12286a92954f3b1727c64e6f896ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BM=CM=x$\" width=\"126\" height=\"12\" />. Then, by Stewart's Theorem, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/d/afd3cf1a1a368ef79905d4e8d3fa41029f467bc9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x^3+18x=16x+64x\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e391428c480e31e2bb9e9ff00e008e3893142584.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies x^2+9=40\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/1/181584bcc40552dafcf9b933095297d4ac21c89c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies x=\\sqrt{31}\\implies BC=\\boxed{2\\sqrt{31}}.\\]\" width=\"266\" height=\"30\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0cdd2d628e533bf874621ae1b229985f8e2996d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"33\" height=\"25\" />\n-brainiacmaniac31\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1975 AHSME Pro